<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in active trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 130.49 to 7,435.78, a record. For the week, the Dow gained 104.74 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite index rose 6.49 to 448.13, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 63 cents.</p>
<p>Advancers outpaced decliners 1,705 to 734.</p>
<p>Volume was 488,349,130 compared with 452,623,120 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,388,439,130 shares.</p>
